The order-four counterexample is real symmetric, nonnegative and
stochastic, has spectrum \(\{1,1,0,-1\}\) and positive trace, and is
spectrally unique up to permutation. It lies outside every segment in
the proposed locus, disproving the universal necessary condition at an
allowed dimension.

